    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.LOG_STORY.SELF_NAME",
      "text": "我",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.LOG_STORY.GREET_1",
      "text": "{pair}擦肩而过,互相点了点头。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.LOG_STORY.GREET_2",
      "text": "{pair}在走廊里打了个招呼。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.LOG_STORY.GREET_3",
      "text": "{pair}碰面时寒暄了两句。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.LOG_STORY.GREET_4",
      "text": "{pair}远远地挥了挥手。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.LOG_STORY.GREET_5",
      "text": "{pair}隔着半条走廊对视了一眼,心照不宣。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.LOG_STORY.GREET_6",
      "text": "{pair}在打印舱前排着队,顺便打了招呼。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.LOG_STORY.CHAT_1",
      "text": "{pair}聊了会儿天。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.LOG_STORY.CHAT_2",
      "text": "{pair}凑在一起闲聊,气氛不错。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.LOG_STORY.CHAT_3",
      "text": "{pair}聊起了家长里短。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.LOG_STORY.CHAT_4",
      "text": "{pair}聊起了{topic}。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.LOG_STORY.CHAT_5",
      "text": "{pair}交换了今天的见闻。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.LOG_STORY.CHAT_6",
      "text": "{pair}有一搭没一搭地聊着,时间过得飞快。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.LOG_STORY.VENT_1",
      "text": "{actor}向{other}倒了一肚子苦水。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.LOG_STORY.VENT_2",
      "text": "{other}听{actor}倾诉了很久。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.LOG_STORY.VENT_3",
      "text": "{actor}把今天的糟心事一件一件数给{other}听。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.LOG_STORY.VENT_4",
      "text": "{actor}问{other}这日子什么时候是个头,{other}答不上来。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.LOG_STORY.VENT_5",
      "text": "苦水倒完了,{actor}觉得肩上的浮土都轻了些。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.LOG_STORY.VENT_STRESS_1",
      "text": "{actor}的情绪快压不住了,{other}陪他坐了一会儿。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.LOG_STORY.TEACH_1",
      "text": "{actor}手把手教{other}干活。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.LOG_STORY.TEACH_2",
      "text": "{actor}给{other}讲了些独门窍门。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.LOG_STORY.TEACH_3",
      "text": "{actor}演示了一遍,{other}看得眼睛都不眨。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.LOG_STORY.TEACH_4",
      "text": "{actor}说只教一遍,{other}决定回去自己偷偷练。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.LOG_STORY.TEACH_5",
      "text": "有些手艺是排班表上学不到的,{actor}传给了{other}。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.LOG_STORY.BESTFRIEND_1",
      "text": "{pair}聊到深夜,成了彼此的挚友。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.LOG_STORY.BESTFRIEND_2",
      "text": "{pair}说了些从没对别人说过的话。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.LOG_STORY.BESTFRIEND_3",
      "text": "{pair}交换了彼此的秘密,从此不分你我。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.LOG_STORY.BESTFRIEND_4",
      "text": "那晚{pair}聊到天亮,谁也没提该睡觉的事。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.LOG_STORY.BESTFRIEND_5",
      "text": "有些人认识很久才是朋友,{pair}只花了一个晚上。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.LOG_STORY.CARE_1",
      "text": "{actor}照顾了{other}。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.LOG_STORY.CARE_2",
      "text": "{actor}帮{other}处理了伤势。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.LOG_STORY.CARE_3",
      "text": "{actor}给{other}换了绷带,动作很轻。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.LOG_STORY.CARE_4",
      "text": "{other}嘴上说着没事,还是让{actor}照看了一整天。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.LOG_STORY.CARE_5",
      "text": "{actor}守在{other}旁边,连药都提前晾温了。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.LOG_STORY.COMFORT_1",
      "text": "{actor}陪着{other},直到他缓过来。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.LOG_STORY.COMFORT_2",
      "text": "{other}在{actor}的陪伴下平静了下来。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.LOG_STORY.COMFORT_3",
      "text": "{actor}没说什么大道理,只是陪着{other}。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.LOG_STORY.COMFORT_4",
      "text": "{other}想说谢谢,{actor}摆摆手让他省点力气。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.LOG_STORY.COMFORT_5",
      "text": "有些夜晚只能熬过去,好在{other}不是一个人熬。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.LOG_STORY.MEAL_1",
      "text": "{pair}在{place}一起吃了顿饭。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.LOG_STORY.MEAL_2",
      "text": "{pair}边吃边聊,很放松。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.LOG_STORY.MEAL_3",
      "text": "{pair}拼了一桌,聊了很久。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.LOG_STORY.MEAL_4",
      "text": "{pair}端着餐盘坐到了一起。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.LOG_STORY.MEAL_5",
      "text": "{pair}分食了一份软泥糕,谁也没嫌弃谁。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.LOG_STORY.MEAL_6",
      "text": "饭菜还是老样子,但{pair}这桌的笑声是新的。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.LOG_STORY.MEAL_COLD_1",
      "text": "{pair}隔着一张桌子,谁也没先开口。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.LOG_STORY.MEAL_COUPLE_1",
      "text": "{pair}挨着坐下,这顿饭吃得很甜。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.LOG_STORY.REST_1",
      "text": "{pair}同屋睡了一晚,作息很合拍。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.LOG_STORY.REST_2",
      "text": "{pair}的床铺挨着,夜里翻身都怕吵到对方。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.LOG_STORY.REST_3",
      "text": "熄灯之后,{pair}又小声聊了一会儿才睡。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.LOG_STORY.REST_4",
      "text": "同一个屋檐下,{pair}连打鼾的节奏都磨合出来了。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.LOG_STORY.REST_CLASH_1",
      "text": "{pair}作息不合,谁都没睡好。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.LOG_STORY.SOCIALIZE_1",
      "text": "{pair}在{place}一起玩了一会儿。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.LOG_STORY.SOCIALIZE_2",
      "text": "{pair}在休息区碰头,玩得很开心。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.LOG_STORY.SOCIALIZE_3",
      "text": "{pair}在{place}消磨了一段好时光。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.LOG_STORY.SOCIALIZE_4",
      "text": "{pair}较量了几局,输赢已经不重要了。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.LOG_STORY.SOCIALIZE_5",
      "text": "{pair}把一天的疲惫都玩没了。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.LOG_STORY.PARTY_1",
      "text": "{pair}参加了{place}的聚会。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.LOG_STORY.PARTY_2",
      "text": "{pair}在聚会上玩开了。",
