      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.LOG_STORY.PARTY_5",
      "text": "{pair}一直待到聚会散场,还意犹未尽。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.LOG_STORY.DATE_1",
      "text": "{pair}约了一次会,气氛正好。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.LOG_STORY.DATE_2",
      "text": "{pair}独处了一会儿,眼里只有彼此。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.LOG_STORY.DATE_3",
      "text": "{pair}并肩散步,谁也没提回工作站的事。",
