    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.LOG_STORY.DATE_5",
      "text": "约会的规矩是{pair}定的:不许谈排班表。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.LOG_STORY.ANNIVERSARY_1",
      "text": "{pair}纪念了在一起的日子。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.LOG_STORY.ANNIVERSARY_2",
      "text": "{pair}又安稳地走过了一年,值得碰一杯。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.LOG_STORY.ANNIVERSARY_3",
      "text": "在这个连日历都要自己记的地方,{pair}没有忘记今天。",
