      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.LOG_STORY.ANNIVERSARY_MISSED_1",
      "text": "{actor}忘了和{other}的纪念日。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.LOG_STORY.ANNIVERSARY_MISSED_2",
      "text": "{actor}的排班表上唯独漏掉了和{other}的纪念日。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.LOG_STORY.ANNIVERSARY_MISSED_3",
      "text": "{other}等了一晚上,{actor}在矿井里浑然不觉。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.LOG_STORY.ANNIVERSARY_MISSED_4",
      "text": "日子一忙就糊涂,{actor}把最重要的那天忘了。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.LOG_STORY.CONFESSION_1",
      "text": "{actor}向{other}表明了心意——{other}答应了。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.LOG_STORY.CONFESSION_2",
      "text": "{actor}鼓起勇气告白,{other}红着脸点了头。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.LOG_STORY.CONFESSION_3",
      "text": "{actor}把练习了十遍的话说到一半,{other}就答应了。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.LOG_STORY.CONFESSION_4",
      "text": "在打印舱的见证下,{actor}和{other}牵起了手。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.LOG_STORY.CONFESSION_5",
      "text": "{other}等这句话等了很久,{actor}终于说出口了。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.LOG_STORY.REKINDLE_1",
      "text": "{pair}重新走到了一起。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.LOG_STORY.REKINDLE_2",
      "text": "{pair}绕了一圈,又回到了彼此身边。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.LOG_STORY.REKINDLE_3",
      "text": "有些分开只是为了想清楚,{pair}想清楚了。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.LOG_STORY.REKINDLE_4",
      "text": "{pair}再次牵起手,比第一次还要用力。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.LOG_STORY.CONFESSION_FAIL_1",
      "text": "{actor}向{other}表白了,但{other}没有答应。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.LOG_STORY.CONFESSION_FAIL_2",
      "text": "{actor}的心意,{other}没能接住。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.LOG_STORY.CONFESSION_FAIL_3",
      "text": "{actor}说完那句排练好的告白,{other}沉默了很久。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.LOG_STORY.CONFESSION_FAIL_4",
      "text": "不是所有真心都有回音,{actor}今天明白了。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.LOG_STORY.BREAKUP_1",
      "text": "{pair}分手了。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.LOG_STORY.BREAKUP_2",
      "text": "{pair}的感情走到了尽头。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.LOG_STORY.BREAKUP_3",
      "text": "{pair}把话说开,然后各自转身。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.LOG_STORY.BREAKUP_4",
      "text": "{pair}的关系,像气压服的氧气一样耗尽了。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.LOG_STORY.BREAKUP_5",
      "text": "{other}还想挽回,{actor}已经不想再谈了。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.LOG_STORY.BOUND_BLOCK_1",
      "text": "{pair}之间像隔着一层看不见的墙,关系停在了原地。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.LOG_STORY.BOUND_BLOCK_2",
      "text": "某种说不清的力量按住了{pair}的缘分,谁也没有再进一步。",
