      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.LOG_STORY.BOUND_BLOCK_3",
      "text": "{pair}的故事刚要翻页,又被无形的手轻轻按住。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.LOG_STORY.BOUND_BLOCK_4",
      "text": "命运在{pair}之间画了一条线,谁也没有跨过去。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.LOG_STORY.BOUND_BLOCK_5",
      "text": "{pair}的关系起了波澜,又莫名其妙地平息了。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.LOG_STORY.FALLOUT_1",
      "text": "{pair}大吵一架,从此形同陌路。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
